    "description": "<p>AURA FEAR SAVE UNLIVING-LICH</p>\n<p>Prerequisites Level 14</p>\n<p>The majesty of undeath gathers around you as a visible pressure on mortal courage.</p>\n<p>Effect: You gain Frightful Aura.</p>\n<p>Works automatically: Frightful Aura — 5 feet × your level; a creature first entering it rolls Will against your Level DC and is then immune for 1 minute whatever the result. The ladder: frightened 1–4, fleeing on a Failure (1 round) or Fumble (while frightened), collapse to 0 HP on a Blunder.</p>",
